\cf0 \

\b I want to run all the tests!\

\b0 Run \'91yarn run protractor \'97 \'97suites all\'92.\
\

\b I want to run tests for one particular page?\

\b0 Run  \'91yarn run protractor \'97 \'97suites pageNameHere\'92.\
\

\b How do I see what tests I can run?\

\b0 Go to \'91/edji-hotrod/config/protractor.conf.js\'92, then look under \'91suites\'92 in that file. Each variable is a pathname to \'91spec.ts\'92 files that that suite uses. Type in the name of the suite after the command \'91yarn run protractor \'97 \'97suites \'91 to run that suite.\
